### Performance Monitoring API Tests

### Base URL
@host = http://localhost:8080/api
@adminToken = Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###

### Get all performance statistics
# @name getPerformanceStats
GET {{host}}/performance/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Get formatted performance report
# @name getPerformanceReport
GET {{host}}/performance/report HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Get monitoring status
# @name getMonitoringStatus
GET {{host}}/performance/status HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Reset all performance metrics
# @name resetPerformanceMetrics
DELETE {{host}}/performance/reset HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Test workflow: Get initial stats, perform operations, check stats again

### Step 1: Get initial performance stats
# @name initialStats
GET {{host}}/performance/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Step 2: Perform some operations (trigger a post fetch)
# @name triggerOperation
GET {{host}}/posts/1 HTTP/1.1

###

### Step 3: Get updated performance stats (should show new metrics)
# @name updatedStats
GET {{host}}/performance/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Step 4: Check monitoring status
# @name checkStatus
GET {{host}}/performance/status HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Step 5: Get full report
# @name fullReport
GET {{host}}/performance/report HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Step 6: Reset metrics
# @name resetMetrics
DELETE {{host}}/performance/reset HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Step 7: Verify metrics were reset
# @name verifyReset
GET {{host}}/performance/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Test without authentication (should fail with 401)
# @name getStatsUnauthorized
GET {{host}}/performance/stats HTTP/1.1

###

### Test with regular user token (should fail with 403)
# @name getStatsAsUser
GET {{host}}/performance/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

###

### Test report without authentication (should fail with 401)
# @name getReportUnauthorized
GET {{host}}/performance/report HTTP/1.1

###

### Test reset without authentication (should fail with 401)
# @name resetUnauthorized
DELETE {{host}}/performance/reset HTTP/1.1

###

### Load testing scenario: Trigger multiple operations and check performance
# @name loadTest1
GET {{host}}/posts?page=1&size=10 HTTP/1.1

###

# @name loadTest2
GET {{host}}/categories HTTP/1.1

###

# @name loadTest3
GET {{host}}/tags?page=1&size=10 HTTP/1.1

###

# @name loadTest4
GET {{host}}/users?page=1&size=10 HTTP/1.1

###

### Check performance after load test
# @name performanceAfterLoad
GET {{host}}/performance/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### Get formatted report after load test
# @name reportAfterLoad
GET {{host}}/performance/report HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###
